sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant E as ESTS
  participant U as User phone
  Note over C,E: arrUserProofs contains TwoWayVoiceMobile, TwoWayVoiceAlternateMobile<br/>or TwoWayVoiceOffice
  C->>E: POST /common/SAS/BeginAuth  header canary
  Note over C,E: {AuthMethodId: TwoWayVoice..., Method: BeginAuth, ctx, flowToken}
  E-->>C: 200 {Success: true, FlowToken, Ctx, SessionId}
  E-)U: automated call (out of band)
  loop poll
    Note over C,E: while Success is false and Retry is true, up to the attempt limit
    C->>E: GET<br/>/common/SAS/EndAuth?authMethodId=TwoWayVoice...&pollCount={n}
    Note over C,E: x-ms-sessionId, x-ms-flowToken, x-ms-ctx
    E-->>C: 200 {Success: false, ResultValue: AuthenticationPending, Retry:<br/>true}
  end
  U->>E: answers and confirms the call
  C->>E: GET /common/SAS/EndAuth?...
  E-->>C: 200 {Success: true, FlowToken, Ctx}
  C->>E: POST /common/SAS/ProcessAuth (form)
  Note over C,E: request, mfaAuthMethod (same value), login, flowToken, canary
  E-->>C: 302 code, or 200 interrupt HTML
